Attribution for world-queries.mjs
================================

Adapted from Mineflayer 4.39.0 lib/plugins/blocks.js and ray_trace.js.
https://github.com/PrismarineJS/mineflayer

Changes: synchronous observed-cache queries without chunk/client dependencies;
complete bounded nearest search; actual eye origins; corrected cursor geometry;
explicit unknown-cell failures. Uses existing world-view.mjs, whose separate
attribution covers the reused prismarine-world geometry. vec3 retains its own
license in the bundled dependency distribution.

